ng 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Adamantine\" title=\"Adamantine\">Adamantine</a>:</b> Found only in meteorites and the rarest of veins in magical areas, this ultrahard metal adds to the quality of a weapon or suit of armor. Weapons made of adamantine have the ability to bypass the protective damage reduction of certain monsters.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">55\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0010000800</span>10,000<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;8<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">gp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Gold Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">6 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><b><a href=\"/page/The_Fall_of_Truth\" title=\"The Fall of Truth\">The Fall of Truth</a></b>, Raid Warded chest (Epic Normal)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+7 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+7 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +7 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Blazing\" title=\"Blazing\">Blazing</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Blazing\" title=\"Blazing\">Blazing</a>:</b> This weapon is sheathed in fierce flame. A blazing weapon deals an extra 2 to 12 points of fire damage on a successful hit.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Stunning\" title=\"Stunning\"> Stunning +10</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Stunning\" title=\"Stunning\"> Stunning +10</a>:</b> +10 Enhancement bonus to the DC of character's Stunning Blow and Stunning Fist attempts.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Ribcracker\" title=\"Ribcracker\">Ribcracker VI</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Ribcracker\" title=\"Ribcracker\">Ribcracker VI</a>:</b> On Critical Hit: 13 to 78 Bludgeoning damage from weapons with a x2 Critical Multiplier, 13 to 104 Bludgeoning damage from weapons with a x3 Critical Multiplier, and 13 to 130 Bludgeoning damage from weapons with a x4 or greater Critical Multiplier.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Attuned_to_Heroism\" title=\"Attuned to Heroism\">Attuned to Heroism</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\">This relic is attuned to heroic actions.</span></span>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/page/Attuned_to_Heroism\" title=\"Attuned to Heroism\">Attuned by Heroism: Tier 1</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+7 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+7 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +7 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span> &#8594; <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+8 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+8 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +8 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Attack_roll\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack</a> and <a href=\"/page/Damage_roll\" title=\"Damage roll\">damage rolls</a>.</span></span></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/page/Attuned_to_Heroism\" title=\"Attuned to Heroism\"> Attuned by Heroism: Tier 2</a>\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Blazing\" title=\"Blazing\">Blazing</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Blazing\" title=\"Blazing\">Blazing</a>:</b> This weapon is sheathed in fierce flame. A blazing weapon deals an extra 2 to 12 points of fire damage on a successful hit.</span></span> &#8594; <span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Conflagrating\" title=\"Conflagrating\">Conflagrating</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Conflagrating\" title=\"Conflagrating\">Conflagrating</a>:</b> This weapon is sheathed in furious flame. A conflagrating weapon deals an extra 3 to 18 points of fire damage on a successful hit.</span></span></li></ul></li></ul></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705465\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.orange>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Orange\"]{background-color:#F4A460;border-color:#0B5B9F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.purple>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Purple\"]{background-color:#DDA0DD;border-color:#225F22}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.green>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Green\"]{background-color:#90EE90;border-color:#6F116F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.yellow>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Yellow\"]{background-color:#EEE8AA;border-color:#111755}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.blue>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Blue\"]{background-color:#87CEFA;border-color:#783105}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.red>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Red\"]{background-color:#FA8072;border-color:#057F8D}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.colorless>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Colorless\"]{background-color:#F8F8FF;border-color:#070700}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.sun>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Sun\"]{background-color:#FFFFC0;border-color:#00003F}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.moon>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a[href*=\"Moon\"]{background-color:#C0FFFF;border-color:#3F0000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title,.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.popup.tooltip>a{border:1px solid;border-radius:3px;padding:1px 3px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title>a{color:#003366}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.title>a:visited{color:#040050}.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment>span.tooltip::after{content:\" augments.\"}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon augment red\"><span class=\"title\"><a href=\"/page/Augment_Slot\" title=\"Augment Slot\">Red Augment Slot</a></span><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Red_augments\" title=\"Category:Red augments\">Red</a> and <a href=\"/page/Category:Colorless_augments\" title=\"Category:Colorless augments\">Colorless</a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mythic_Boost\" title=\"Mythic Boost\">Mythic Weapon Boost</a> +2 or +4:</b> +2 or +4 <a href=\"/page/Mythic_bonus\" title=\"Mythic bonus\">Mythic bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Melee_Power\" title=\"Melee Power\">Melee</a>, <a href=\"/page/Ranged_Power\" title=\"Ranged Power\">Ranged</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Universal_Spell_Power\" title=\"Universal Spell Power\">Universal Spell Power</a>.<br />(<i>This is a rare enchantment that does not show up on all drops of this item.</i>)</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Braisingstar.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Braisingstar.png/420px-Braisingstar.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"674\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Braisingstar.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p><a href=\"/page/Stormreaver_Monument\" title=\"Stormreaver Monument\">Stormreaver Monument</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>The hill giant shaman Brawnpits, renowned throughout Gianthold for his haute cuisine, has been wielding this morningstar to perfect his art. Not only is it excellent at the task of tenderizing meat, but the heat it gives off can also cook a carcass to perfection. From the distinctive smell, you suspect Brawnpits may also have been using it to stir a pot of his trademark stew.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">Tier 1<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Braisingstar_(Tier_1).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Braisingstar_%28Tier_1%29.png/450px-Braisingstar_%28Tier_1%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"450\" height=\"722\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Braisingstar_%28Tier_1%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span></span></span>: Epic Hard or with 5&#32;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Item:Commendation_of_Heroism\" title=\"Item:Commendation of Heroism\">Commendations of Heroism</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Item:Commendation_of_Heroism\" title=\"Item:Commendation of Heroism\">Commendation of Heroism</a>:</b> This is a valuable item that can be exchanged for goods if brought to a Challenge Trader.  You can exchange it in <a href=\"/page/Eveningstar\" title=\"Eveningstar\">Eveningstar</a> for powerful equipment.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">Tier 2<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Braisingstar_(Tier_2).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Braisingstar_%28Tier_2%29.png/450px-Braisingstar_%28Tier_2%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"450\" height=\"708\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Braisingstar_%28Tier_2%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span></span></span>: Epic Elite or with 7&#32;<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Item:Commendation_of_Heroism\" title=\"Item:Commendation of Heroism\">Commendations of Heroism</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Item:Commendation_of_Heroism\" title=\"Item:Commendation of Heroism\">Commendation of Heroism</a>:</b> This is a valuable item that can be exchanged for goods if brought to a Challenge Trader.  You can exchange it in <a href=\"/page/Eveningstar\" title=\"Eveningstar\">Eveningstar</a> for powerful equipment.</span></span> (12 total)</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817201456\nCa